sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin as Household Administrator
  participant UI as EMS Razor Pages
  participant API as Device API / Identity
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant ESP as ESP32 firmware

  Admin->>UI: Reauthenticate and request provisioning code
  UI->>API: Authorized provisioning-code request
  API->>DB: Store hashed, short-lived single-use code
  API-->>UI: Display code once
  Admin->>ESP: Configure device code and one-time code locally
  ESP->>ESP: Connect Wi-Fi and synchronize NTP
  ESP->>API: HTTPS POST /api/device-auth/provision
  API->>DB: Validate code, device state and expiry
  API->>DB: Create encrypted device credential / recovery record
  API-->>ESP: Return device secret over validated HTTPS
  ESP->>ESP: Persist credential in NVS
  ESP->>API: Signed heartbeat with HMAC headers
  API->>DB: Validate signature, timestamp and nonce; update last-seen
  API-->>ESP: Heartbeat accepted
